  "description": "Production-ready cache abstraction for .NET 8, .NET 9 and .NET 10 with In-Memory caching, extensible external storage, tag-based invalidation, HTTP response caching, and OpenTelemetry metrics.",
  "id": "CoreSystem.Cache",
